        },
        {
          "text": "Mbaaba bana ba-Davida mbaakazyalilwa ku-Hebroni: mutaanzi kali Amnoni mwana wa-Ahinoamu mu-Jezreeli; awabili kali Daniele mwana wa-Abigayeli waku-Karimeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
