        {
          "text": "Abo bali musanu aumwi bakazyalwa ku-Hebroni, nkwaakeendelezya myaka iili musanu aibili amyezi iili musanu aumwi, Nkabela wakeendelezya mu-Jerusalemu myaka iili makumi otatwe amyaka yotatwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
